{"product_id":"the-tenant-1","title":"The Tenant","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"294\" data-end=\"504\"\u003ePicture this: a quiet Copenhagen morning, a freshly brewed coffee, and a homicide that makes even the most seasoned detectives flinch. Welcome to \u003cem data-start=\"440\" data-end=\"452\"\u003eThe Tenant\u003c\/em\u003e, where Scandinavian calm meets Nordic noir chaos.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"506\" data-end=\"920\"\u003eWhen a young woman is found brutally murdered in her apartment — the walls painted with eerie precision and a trail that screams “literary nightmare” — Detectives Jeppe Kørner and Anette Werner are thrown headfirst into a case that’s anything but ordinary. The real twist? The victim’s landlady — a sweet, aspiring novelist — had written \u003cem data-start=\"844\" data-end=\"863\"\u003ethat exact murder\u003c\/em\u003e into her unfinished manuscript. Coincidence? You wish.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"1185\"\u003eKatrine Engberg, Denmark’s new queen of crime fiction, crafts a debut that’s razor-sharp, atmospheric, and darkly addictive. The cobblestone streets of Copenhagen hide more than pastries and bicycles — they hide secrets that will make you double-lock your door.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1354\"\u003eThink \u003cem data-start=\"1193\" data-end=\"1226\"\u003eThe Girl with the Dragon Tattoo\u003c\/em\u003e meets \u003cem data-start=\"1233\" data-end=\"1246\"\u003eThe Killing\u003c\/em\u003e — with a literary twist and characters so human, you’ll want to buy them a coffee… then interrogate them.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1356\" data-end=\"1511\"\u003eIf you love your thrillers elegant, your detectives flawed, and your plots disturbingly clever, \u003cem data-start=\"1452\" data-end=\"1464\"\u003eThe Tenant\u003c\/em\u003e is the key you didn’t know you were missing.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1545\" data-end=\"1574\"\u003eAuthor: Katrine Engberg\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1545\" data-end=\"1574\"\u003eFormat: Paperback \/ eBook \/ Hardcover (choose your poison)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1698\" data-end=\"1714\"\u003ePages: 384\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1756\" data-end=\"1781\"\u003eISBN: 9781982127572\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1784\" data-end=\"1822\"\u003eDimensions: 5.3 x 0.9 x 8 inches\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45871326134425,"sku":"12RB9781529344639","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/46221964.jpg?v=1762593632","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/the-tenant-1","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}